    "title": "El-Ad's $1B District at Davie project gets a new name - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Yellig ,\n1 days ago El-Ad National Properties recently renamed its $1 billion mixed-use development in Davie from The District at Davie to The Plaza Davie District. The rebrand seeks to reflect the South Florida lifestyle and project “a more immersive, amenity-driven environment that blends residential living with a destination experience,” El-Ad said. The name also reflects El-Ad’s work in repositioning landmark properties, including its redevelopment of The Plaza Hotel in New York City. Read full article",
